    "# Q1 : Word Root Analysis of Social Media Posts:\n",
    "A social media analytics company wants to analyze public posts related to Artificial Intelligence (AI) to identify\n",
    "important topics and understand how different forms of words contribute to word frequency. Since live Twitter/X\n",
    "data is not available, the company provides a dataset containing 100 sample Twitter posts.\n",
    "Question: Develop a Python program to perform word root analysis on the given 100 Twitter posts. The program\n",
    "should:\n",
    "1. Preprocess and clean the tweet text by converting it to lowercase and removing unwanted characters.\n",
    "2. Tokenize the tweets into individual words and remove common stopwords.\n",
    "3. Apply Porter Stemmer and Snowball Stemmer to obtain word stems.\n",
    "4. Apply spaCy Lemmatization to obtain meaningful dictionary forms of words.\n",
    "5. Use Counter to calculate the frequency of the original words, stemmed words, and lemmatized words.\n",
    "6. Display the top 10 most frequent words for each method.\n",
    "7. Compare the results of Porter stemming, Snowball stemming, and lemmatization and explain the\n",
    "differences with suitable examples."
   ]
  },
